      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "SEVA & YOU",
        "body": "<p>Real rituals. Real results. Real moments of reconnection. From fuller-feeling hair to calmer evenings, SEVA is loved by those seeking beauty that feels both effective and emotionally grounding.</p>",
