    "faq": {
      "type": "section-accordion-group",
      "blocks": {
        "q_used_for": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "How often should I use SEVA Hair Strengthening Oil?",
            "content": "<p>For best results, use 1–2 times per week as a pre-wash treatment. Leave it on for at least 30 minutes, or overnight for a deeper nourishing treatment. Consistency is key for healthier-looking, stronger-feeling hair.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_how_use": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What's the best way to use SEVA Hair Strengthening Oil?",
            "content": "<p>For the ultimate hair ritual, pair SEVA with our Kansa Comb. Apply a few drops directly to your scalp and gently massage with the comb for 3–5 minutes before working the remaining oil through your lengths. Inspired by traditional Indian hair oiling rituals, the Kansa Comb helps evenly distribute the oil while delivering a relaxing scalp massage. Think of it as a gua sha for your scalp.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_how_often": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Will it help with hair thinning and shedding?",
            "content": "<p>SEVA is formulated with nutrient-rich botanical oils traditionally used to support a healthy scalp and stronger-looking hair. With consistent use, many customers notice less breakage, healthier-looking hair, and improved softness and shine.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_how_long": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Will it leave my hair feeling greasy?",
            "content": "<p>No. We formulated SEVA with a lightweight blend of botanical oils that deeply nourish the scalp and hair without feeling heavy. Designed as a pre-wash treatment, it rinses out easily with shampoo, leaving your hair feeling soft, healthy and nourished.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_treated": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What does SEVA smell like?",
            "content": "<p>SEVA has a calming, spa-like botanical aroma crafted from pure essential oils including lavender, bergamot, frankincense and rosemary. The scent is naturally fresh, grounding and luxurious, with no synthetic fragrances.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_hair_types": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Is it suitable for all hair types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. SEVA is suitable for all hair types, including straight, wavy, curly and coily hair. Whether your hair is fine, thick, dry or colour-treated, the lightweight botanical blend is designed to nourish both the scalp and hair without weighing it down.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "q_used_for",
        "q_how_use",
